r  a juggler you know anything cool  Plus which sounds much more impressive  when you find out that it stands for the  Public Library of Science recently  published a study that found surgery  students who spent a month playing games  like Wii tennis perform better and  hand-eye coordination tests so the next  time someone tells you that you're  playing too many video games send them  this video let them know you're training  to be a surgeon
 

